\f0\fs24 \cf0 # K\uc0\u7871  Ho\u7841 ch Tri\u7875 n Khai: Web App Trade T\u7921  \u272 \u7897 ng Exness (Full-Stack TypeScript)\
\
X\'e2y d\uc0\u7921 ng n\u7873 n t\u7843 ng Web App ho\'e0n ch\u7881 nh s\u7917  d\u7909 ng **100% TypeScript** t\u7915  Frontend \u273 \u7871 n Backend \u273 \u7875  t\u7921  \u273 \u7897 ng giao d\u7883 ch s\'e0n Exness k\u7871 t n\u7889 i MT5 & TradingView.\
\
---\
\
## 1. C\'f4ng Ngh\uc0\u7879  \u272 \u7873  Xu\u7845 t (Full-Stack TypeScript)\
\
- **Backend (Node.js + TypeScript)**:\
  - Runtime: Node.js (v25.3 c\'f3 s\uc0\u7861 n) v\u7899 i `tsx` / `ts-node` ch\u7841 y TypeScript tr\u7921 c ti\u7871 p si\'eau t\u7889 c.\
  - Framework: **Express.js** + **ws** (WebSocket server hi\uc0\u7879 u n\u259 ng cao).\
  - Database: **SQLite** (l\uc0\u432 u tr\u7919  Rules, L\u7879 nh, L\u7883 ch s\u7917  chat c\u7911 a Bot, C\u7845 u h\'ecnh t\'e0i kho\u7843 n).\
  - Ph\'e2n t\'edch k\uc0\u7929  thu\u7853 t: Thu\u7853 t to\'e1n ch\u7881  b\'e1o vi\u7871 t b\u7857 ng TypeScript (RSI 14, EMA 20/50/200, Bollinger Bands, MACD, ATR).\
  - Bot Engine: V\'f2ng l\uc0\u7863 p async b\u7845 t \u273 \u7891 ng b\u7897  (TypeScript Event-driven), qu\'e9t n\u7871 n & tick li\'ean t\u7909 c, kh\u7899 p \u273 i\u7873 u ki\u7879 n quy t\u7855 c t\u7921  \u273 \u7897 ng, qu\u7843 n l\'fd r\u7911 i ro v\'e0 ph\'e1t t\'edn hi\u7879 u.\
  - K\uc0\u7871 t n\u7889 i:\
    - **TradingView Webhook Handler**: Nh\uc0\u7853 n t\'edn hi\u7879 u tr\u7921 c ti\u7871 p t\u7915  PineScript alerts.\
    - **MT5 / Exness Bridge & Paper Trading Engine**: M\'f4 ph\uc0\u7887 ng kh\u7899 p l\u7879 nh th\u7921 c t\u7871  chu\u7849 n s\'e0n Exness (Spread, Balance $10,000, Leverage 1:500, SL/TP execution) v\'e0 giao di\u7879 n k\u7871 t n\u7889 i API/Socket t\u7899 i MT5 terminal.\
- **Frontend (React + Vite + TypeScript)**:\
  - Framework: React 18 + Vite + TypeScript.\
  - Styling: Tailwind CSS v3 (Fintech Dark Mode phong c\'e1ch TradingView Pro / Binance Pro, Glassmorphism).\
  - Bi\uc0\u7875 u \u273 \u7891  n\u7871 n: **TradingView Lightweight Charts** (th\u432  vi\u7879 n ch\'ednh h\'e3ng c\u7911 a TradingView d\'e0nh cho TypeScript/React, c\u7921 c nh\u7865  v\'e0 m\u432 \u7907 t).\
  - Icons: `lucide-react`.\
  - K\uc0\u7871 t n\u7889 i d\u7919  li\u7879 u: WebSocket client nh\u7853 n tick gi\'e1, n\u7871 n, PnL, tin nh\u7855 n bot chat real-time.\
\
