## 3. Chi Ti\uc0\u7871 t C\'e1c T\'ednh N\u259 ng Theo Y\'eau C\u7847 u\
\
### Menu 1: Trang Ch\uc0\u7911  (Dashboard)\
- **B\'ean tr\'e1i**:\
  - Ticker bar ch\uc0\u7885 n c\u7863 p ti\u7873 n: **XAU/USD (V\'e0ng)**, **EUR/USD**, **GBP/USD**, **USD/JPY**, **BTC/USD**.\
  - Ch\uc0\u7885 n khung th\u7901 i gian: **M1**, **M5**, **M15**, **H1**.\
  - Bi\uc0\u7875 u \u273 \u7891  n\u7871 n t\u432 \u417 ng t\'e1c cao t\u7915  **TradingView Lightweight Charts** v\u7899 i n\u7871 n nh\u7843 y t\u7915 ng gi\'e2y.\
  - T\'edch h\uc0\u7907 p v\u7869  \u273 \u432 \u7901 ng ch\u7881  b\'e1o: **EMA 20** (v\'e0ng), **EMA 50** (t\'edm), **Bollinger Bands** (xanh l\u417 ), v\'e0 khung bi\u7875 u \u273 \u7891  ph\u7909  **RSI 14** b\'ean d\u432 \u7899 i v\u7899 i m\u7913 c 30/70.\
  - B\uc0\u7843 ng **L\u7879 nh \u273 ang m\u7903  (Open Positions)** ngay d\u432 \u7899 i bi\u7875 u \u273 \u7891 : hi\u7875 n th\u7883  Kh\u7889 i l\u432 \u7907 ng, Gi\'e1 v\'e0o, Gi\'e1 hi\u7879 n t\u7841 i, SL, TP, PnL bi\u7871 n \u273 \u7897 ng real-time, n\'fat \u272 \'f3ng l\u7879 nh t\u7913 c th\'ec.\
- **B\'ean ph\uc0\u7843 i**:\
  - **Thanh Chat Bot**:\
    - Hi\uc0\u7875 n th\u7883  theo th\u7901 i gian th\u7921 c m\u7885 i suy lu\u7853 n v\'e0 h\'e0nh \u273 \u7897 ng c\u7911 a bot.\
    - \uc0\u272 \u7883 nh d\u7841 ng th\u7867  tin nh\u7855 n tr\u7921 c quan:\
      - \uc0\u55357 \u57314  **L\u7879 nh MUA m\u7899 i** (K\'e8m Lot, Gi\'e1, SL, TP, L\'fd do k\'edch ho\u7841 t t\u7915  Y\'eau c\u7847 u t\u7921  \u273 \u7897 ng n\'e0o).\
      - \uc0\u55357 \u56628  **L\u7879 nh B\'c1N m\u7899 i**.\
      - \uc0\u55357 \u56496  **Ch\u7889 t l\u7901 i (Take Profit) / C\u7855 t l\u7895  (Stop Loss)** v\u7899 i s\u7889  ti\u7873 n l\'e3i/l\u7895  xanh/\u273 \u7887 .\
      - \uc0\u55357 \u56589  **Ph\'e2n t\'edch k\u7929  thu\u7853 t \u273 \u7883 nh k\u7923 **: T\'ecnh tr\u7841 ng RSI, EMA, xu h\u432 \u7899 ng.\
      - \uc0\u9888 \u65039  **C\u7843 nh b\'e1o r\u7911 i ro**: Bi\u7871 n \u273 \u7897 ng m\u7841 nh, ng\u432 \u7907 c xu h\u432 \u7899 ng.\
    - Khung nh\uc0\u7853 p tin nh\u7855 n: Ng\u432 \u7901 i d\'f9ng c\'f3 th\u7875  chat tr\u7921 c ti\u7871 p v\u7899 i bot (v\'ed d\u7909 : g\'f5 `\u273 \'f3ng h\u7871 t l\u7879 nh`, `t\u7841 m d\u7915 ng bot`, `b\u7853 t bot`, `b\'e1o c\'e1o`).\
\
### Menu 2: C\'e1c Y\'eau C\uc0\u7847 u T\u7921  \u272 \u7897 ng (Automations)\
- **Danh s\'e1ch y\'eau c\uc0\u7847 u t\u7921  \u273 \u7897 ng**:\
  - Th\uc0\u7867  hi\u7875 n th\u7883  tr\u7921 c quan th\'f4ng s\u7889  t\u7915 ng chi\u7871 n l\u432 \u7907 c: T\'ean, C\u7863 p ti\u7873 n, Khung th\u7901 i gian, \u272 i\u7873 u ki\u7879 n k\'edch ho\u7841 t, Kh\u7889 i l\u432 \u7907 ng (Lot), C\u7855 t l\u7895  (SL), Ch\u7889 t l\u7901 i (TP), Tr\u7841 ng th\'e1i (\u272 ang B\u7853 t / \u272 ang T\u7855 t).\
  - Th\uc0\u7889 ng k\'ea hi\u7879 u su\u7845 t: S\u7889  l\u7879 nh \u273 \'e3 v\'e0o, T\u7927  l\u7879  th\u7855 ng (Win Rate), T\u7893 ng l\u7907 i nhu\u7853 n t\u7915  y\'eau c\u7847 u n\'e0y.\
- **Th\'eam y\'eau c\uc0\u7847 u m\u7899 i (Create Rule Modal)**:\
  - C\uc0\u7845 u h\'ecnh \u273 i\u7873 u ki\u7879 n linh ho\u7841 t:\
    - **RSI**: Qu\'e1 b\'e1n (RSI < 30) -> MUA, Qu\'e1 mua (RSI > 70) -> B\'c1N.\
    - **EMA Crossover**: EMA 20 c\uc0\u7855 t l\'ean EMA 50 -> MUA, c\u7855 t xu\u7889 ng -> B\'c1N.\
    - **Bollinger Bands**: Gi\'e1 ch\uc0\u7841 m d\u7843 i d\u432 \u7899 i -> MUA, ch\u7841 m d\u7843 i tr\'ean -> B\'c1N.\
    - **TradingView Webhook**: L\uc0\u7855 ng nghe t\'edn hi\u7879 u c\u7843 nh b\'e1o t\u7915  TradingView PineScript.\
  - Qu\uc0\u7843 n l\'fd v\u7889 n: Lot size (0.01 - 10.0), Stop Loss (pips), Take Profit (pips), Trailing Stop (pips), Gi\u7899 i h\u7841 n s\u7889  l\u7879 nh \u273 \u7891 ng th\u7901 i.\
- **S\uc0\u7917 a y\'eau c\u7847 u (Update Rule)**: Ch\u7881 nh s\u7917 a t\u7913 c th\'ec c\'e1c th\'f4ng s\u7889  v\'e0 c\u7853 p nh\u7853 t ngay v\'e0o v\'f2ng l\u7863 p c\u7911 a Bot.\
- **Xo\'e1 y\'eau c\uc0\u7847 u (Delete Rule)**: X\'e1c nh\u7853 n xo\'e1 an to\'e0n.\
- **T\'edch h\uc0\u7907 p Webhook TradingView**:\
  - Hi\uc0\u7875 n th\u7883  URL Webhook c\'e1 nh\'e2n h\'f3a v\'e0 c\'fa ph\'e1p JSON m\u7851 u s\u7861 n s\'e0ng copy \u273 \u7875  d\'e1n v\'e0o h\u7897 p tho\u7841 i Alert tr\'ean TradingView.\
\
