## 4. K\uc0\u7871  Ho\u7841 ch Ki\u7875 m Th\u7917  & X\'e1c Minh\
\
1. **Backend Verification**:\
   - Kh\uc0\u7903 i \u273 \u7897 ng backend TypeScript v\u7899 i `tsx`.\
   - Ki\uc0\u7875 m tra REST API: CRUD t\u7841 o, \u273 \u7885 c, c\u7853 p nh\u7853 t, xo\'e1 y\'eau c\u7847 u t\u7921  \u273 \u7897 ng.\
   - Ki\uc0\u7875 m tra endpoint webhook `/api/webhook/tradingview` k\'edch ho\u7841 t l\u7879 nh chu\u7849 n x\'e1c.\
   - Ki\uc0\u7875 m tra WebSocket ph\'e1t d\u7919  li\u7879 u tick v\'e0 tin nh\u7855 n chat bot th\u7901 i gian th\u7921 c.\
2. **Frontend Verification**:\
   - Ki\uc0\u7875 m tra build TypeScript `npm run build` kh\'f4ng c\'f3 b\u7845 t k\u7923  l\u7895 i c\'fa ph\'e1p hay ki\u7875 u d\u7919  li\u7879 u n\'e0o.\
   - Kh\uc0\u7903 i ch\u7841 y web app tr\'ean tr\'ecnh duy\u7879 t, ki\u7875 m tra bi\u7875 u \u273 \u7891  n\u7871 n, thanh chat bot b\'ean ph\u7843 i, b\u7843 ng l\u7879 nh m\u7903 .\
   - Th\uc0\u7917  nghi\u7879 m thao t\'e1c t\u7841 o m\u7897 t y\'eau c\u7847 u t\u7921  \u273 \u7897 ng m\u7899 i (v\'ed d\u7909 : RSI Scalping), k\'edch ho\u7841 t v\'e0 quan s\'e1t bot t\u7921  \u273 \u7897 ng ph\'e2n t\'edch, ph\'e1t tin nh\u7855 n chat v\'e0 v\'e0o l\u7879 nh.\
